  "question": {
    "text": "The figure shows three circuits <math><mi>I</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>I</mi><mi>I</mi></math> and <math><mi>I</mi><mi>I</mi><mi>I</mi></math> which are connected to a <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math> battery. If the powers dissipated by the configurations <math><mi>I</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>I</mi><mi>I</mi></math> and <math><mi>I</mi><mi>I</mi><mi>I</mi></math> are <math><msub><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msub><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> and <math><msub><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math> respectively, then -<br /><br /><img src=\"assets\\qt0311_5d2292abc59c.png\" style=\"width: 600px; height: 184px;\" />"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><msub><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math>",
      "is_correct": true
